    "sections": {
        "description": "Grove App Business is a modern Full Site Editing WordPress theme built for businesses, agencies, startups, and technology companies looking to create a professional and engaging online presence. With flexible layouts, customizable sections, and clean typography, it makes it easy to showcase your services, products, team, projects, pricing, testimonials, and business achievements. Seamlessly integrated with WooCommerce, WPML, and Contact Form 7, it supports online stores, multilingual websites, and effective customer communication. Designed with SEO, performance, and usability in mind, Grove App Business helps you build a fast, responsive, and conversion-focused business website that strengthens your brand and connects with your audience. Demo: https://demos.themegrove.com/grove-app-business/"
    },
